# EdgeLab environment variables.
# Everything is optional. With no variables set, EdgeLab runs in demo mode
# with deterministic synthetic market data (labelled everywhere) and
# browser-local persistence.

# --- Market data (server-only; never exposed to the browser) --------------
# EODHD (https://eodhd.com): real historical data for ASX (exchange code AU),
# US equities and crypto. End-of-day bars are split- and dividend-adjusted;
# intraday bars are unadjusted; quotes are delayed 15–20 minutes.
# Plan notes (verified on eodhd.com/pricing, Nov 2026): the free tier is
# 20 calls/day on a limited symbol set; "EOD Historical All-World" is the
# lowest tier with full ASX end-of-day history; intraday for AU needs the
# "EOD + Intraday All-World Extended" tier or higher.
# EODHD_API_TOKEN=

# Coinbase Exchange public candles for crypto (no key). Set to "coinbase" to
# enable when EODHD is not configured.
# MARKET_DATA_PROVIDER=demo

# --- AI research assistant (server-only) -----------------------------------
# When unset, the assistant runs its deterministic rule-based analysts only.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-opus-5-5

# --- Optional persistence (Supabase; not wired in this release) -------------
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# --- Link previews (public, not a secret) ---------------------------------
# Absolute origin used for Open Graph image URLs in WhatsApp, Messenger and
# X previews. On Vercel the production host is picked up automatically, so
# set this only for a custom domain.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://edgelab.example.com
